# Cloudflare Pages reads this beside the static demo's files (see
# docs/demo.md). The demo's addresses in the app (/demo, /demo/spider) are its views
# here, at the root. Any other address is the page itself, which shows the
# view it names (Pages serves index.html for it, as there is no 404.html).
# The Web is now the Spider web: /web, and the app's /demo/web, lead to /spider
# (listed first, as Pages takes the first rule that matches).
/web /spider 301
/web/ /spider 301
/demo/web /spider 301
/demo/web/ /spider 301
/demo /  301
/demo/* /:splat 301
